Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,EVERY CHILD
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.80,0:00:03.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,IN THE CLAN FACED THE BEAST.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.82,0:00:06.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,EVERY CHILD WAS REJECTED.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:17.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,WATCH HOW
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.77,0:00:20.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,A CHIEFTAIN'S SON DOES IT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:32.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,NOT YOU, CHILD.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.20,0:00:34.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,IT WILL TEAR YOU APART.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:45.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,I CAN'T SEE YOU.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.45,0:00:46.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,BUT I CAN
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.27,0:00:48.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,HEAR YOU'RE LONELY.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:04.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,VORR HASN'T BOWED
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:05.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,IN THREE HUNDRED YEARS...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.40,0:01:30.00,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}SHE WASN'T BLIND.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.60,0:01:30.00,Card2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}SHE WAS WAITING.
